224
00:08:40,516 --> 00:08:42,856
though our sources give no average.

225
00:08:43,036 --> 00:08:44,364
By our arithmetic,

226
00:08:44,364 --> 00:08:46,945
five hundred cars at the list price

227
00:08:46,945 --> 00:08:50,633
come to three hundred seventy-five million pounds,

228
00:08:50,633 --> 00:08:52,034
