229
00:08:52,384 --> 00:08:55,763
What happened afterwards tells us about value.

230
00:08:55,943 --> 00:08:58,732
Wikipedia says the last Senna sold at

231
00:08:58,732 --> 00:09:02,048
auction for one million nine hundred sixteen

232
00:09:02,048 --> 00:09:05,289
thousand seven hundred ninety-three pounds.

233
00:09:05,469 --> 00:09:06,905
By our arithmetic,

234
00:09:06,905 --> 00:09:09,138
that is two and a half times

235
00:09:09,138 --> 00:09:10,335
the list price,

236
00:09:10,335 --> 00:09:12,967
a gain of one million one hundred

237
00:09:12,967 --> 00:09:17,195
