238
00:09:17,375 --> 00:09:19,248
The page does not say when or

239
00:09:19,248 --> 00:09:20,928
where the sale took place.

240
00:09:21,278 --> 00:09:22,659
That is one car.

241
00:09:22,839 --> 00:09:24,864
It may have been special as the

242
00:09:24,864 --> 00:09:25,908
final one built,

243
00:09:25,908 --> 00:09:27,933
and the sources do not say what

244
00:09:27,933 --> 00:09:29,631
a typical Senna sells for.

245
00:09:29,811 --> 00:09:31,955
So we cannot say the model gained

246
00:09:31,955 --> 00:09:34,165
