260
00:10:01,554 --> 00:10:04,158
Our sources give no exchange rates or

261
00:10:04,158 --> 00:10:07,042
inflation figures, and we will not invent

262
00:10:07,042 --> 00:10:07,394
them.

263
00:10:07,745 --> 00:10:10,431
Price per horsepower is at least in

264
00:10:10,431 --> 00:10:12,272
