267
00:10:18,550 --> 00:10:21,427
by our arithmetic about nine hundred fifty

268
00:10:21,427 --> 00:10:22,797
pounds a horsepower.

269
00:10:22,977 --> 00:10:25,874
The Czinger is about thirteen hundred sixty

270
00:10:25,874 --> 00:10:26,413
dollars.

271
00:10:26,593 --> 00:10:28,975
Different money, so not comparable,

272
00:10:28,975 --> 00:10:31,220
but both are in the high hundreds

273
00:10:31,220 --> 00:10:33,397
or low thousands per horsepower.

274
00:10:33,747 --> 00:10:35,860
Waiting is part of the price.

275
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:38,106
The Senna's timeline was short.

276
00:10:38,286 --> 00:10:41,427
It was revealed online in December twenty

277
00:10:41,427 --> 00:10:43,725
seventeen and, Wikipedia says,

278
00:10:43,725 --> 00:10:46,790
deliveries began in the third quarter of

279
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:48,015
twenty eighteen.

280
00:10:48,195 --> 00:10:49,468
By our arithmetic,

